# One trailer closes more than one open level (the author 2026-11-11, LMX_blog/2026-11-11.md#one-level-needs-no-close):
# `end: Other` at the level of Other closes Other across the open Point, its target is the head of the Frame it closes
# (grammar §17), and the construction admits it.
Other:
    Point:
        int: x 4
end: Other
int: after 1
